  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added ImmediateLoggerExtensions with LogImmediateInformation, LogImmediateWarning, LogImmediateError, and BeginImmediateScope — extension methods on ILogger that bypass the step-up LevelSwitch and always export. Internally refactored the step-up branch into a dedicated StepUpSink and added ImmediateSink; both guarantee exactly-once delivery. New OpenTelemetry meter StepUpLogging.Immediate tracks immediate-routed events.",
